        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to learn Blender but don't know where to start? <strong>Start here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for <i>complete beginners</i>. If you already know Blender, this game is <strong>not</strong> for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Skills Start Here</strong> teaches your first steps in Blender through play, mini games, and puzzles. No tutorials to sit through. You learn by doing. If you already know what G, R, and S do, you're past what this game teaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backed by over 1,000 supporters on Kickstarter and built by a small team that believes learning Blender shouldn't start with countless YouTube videos you pause every 8 seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you'll learn:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbit, Pan, Zoom — move the camera and look around a 3D scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View Selected — snap your view to any object instantly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, Rotate, Scale — place, spin, and resize objects exactly where you want them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delete, Add Objects — clear the scene and bring in new shapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera Render — frame a shot and capture it as an image</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Object vs Edit Mode — switch between moving whole objects and reshaping them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertices, Edges, Faces — select and edit the building blocks of any 3D model</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Creator Cards</strong> are hidden throughout the game, each featuring a real Blender creator and their work. Finish the game and you'll know exactly where to keep learning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suzanne is your guide. DUBE is your problem. Pick up the skills, free your friends, and find out if you've got what it takes to start creating in 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to share your feedback on the EA?</strong> Join our Discord server!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to learn Blender but don't know where to start? <strong>Start here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for <i>complete beginners</i>. If you already know Blender, this game is <strong>not</strong> for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Skills Start Here</strong> teaches your first steps in Blender through play, mini games, and puzzles. No tutorials to sit through. You learn by doing. If you already know what G, R, and S do, you're past what this game teaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backed by over 1,000 supporters on Kickstarter and built by a small team that believes learning Blender shouldn't start with countless YouTube videos you pause every 8 seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you'll learn:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbit, Pan, Zoom — move the camera and look around a 3D scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View Selected — snap your view to any object instantly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, Rotate, Scale — place, spin, and resize objects exactly where you want them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delete, Add Objects — clear the scene and bring in new shapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera Render — frame a shot and capture it as an image</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Object vs Edit Mode — switch between moving whole objects and reshaping them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertices, Edges, Faces — select and edit the building blocks of any 3D model</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Creator Cards</strong> are hidden throughout the game, each featuring a real Blender creator and their work. Finish the game and you'll know exactly where to keep learning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suzanne is your guide. DUBE is your problem. Pick up the skills, free your friends, and find out if you've got what it takes to start creating in 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to share your feedback on the EA?</strong> Join our Discord server!</p>",
        "short_description": "Want to learn Blender but don't know where to start? START HERE! *Share your feedback on our Discord!",
